			"notes": "Sentient brings Minecraft villagers to life with AI-powered contextual dialogue and unique personalities.\nVillagers react naturally to player interactions, trades, and their surroundings.\nTheir moods and relationships evolve through deterministic game-driven systems.\n\n\nChangelog — Sentient 1.0.0\n\nAdded:\nAI-powered contextual dialogue for Minecraft villagers.\nUnique villager names and personalities.\nContext-aware responses to player interactions and trades.\nTrade session tracking with repeated trades aggregated by item and quantity.\nDeterministic villager moods, satisfaction, and mutable states.\nPersistent villager profiles and interaction history.\nEnvironment-aware greeting dialogue with caching.\nLive debug HUD for inspecting villager and AI state.\nStructured AI responses with validation.\nConfigurable runtime parameters through the mod configuration.\nOpenRouter integration for AI-generated dialogue.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Auth0x78/Sentivia-Mod/commits/v1.0.0"
		}
